The LP formulation, as well as the intrinsic convexity of the basic CVaR/ETL
problem was established by Rockafellar and Uryasev (2000).  With mETL none
of those results follow.    

Doug

P.S. I don't know if you noticed that Zhang was my Ph.D. student.   



